# 2026-08-17 v2.6.1 骨架阶段：保留远端 v2.6.0 的 flask-app/ 整体忽略约定
# 同时允许 flask-app/ai_engines/ 下 ai_intelligent_upgrade_engine.py + mt_ir14_dev_flow.py
# 骨架引擎 2 个文件单独入库（11 个 target files 之一）
flask-app/*
!flask-app/ai_engines/
flask-app/ai_engines/*
!flask-app/ai_engines/ai_intelligent_upgrade_engine.py
!flask-app/ai_engines/mt_ir14_dev_flow.py
# v22.7.0 巡检缺口发现引擎架构优化: 允许 flask-app/engines/auto_dev_team_engine.py 入库
# (5维×3=15硬伤+3运行BUG修复: 算法_py_index复用/权重GapPrioritizer唯一入口/架构4阶段Pipeline/逻辑IR14单事务批量/框架连接池+缓存TTL)
!flask-app/engines/
flask-app/engines/*
!flask-app/engines/auto_dev_team_engine.py
# v22.4.0 AI建议驱动修复引擎: 允许 ai_suggested_repair_engine.py + ai_smart_mount_engine.py 入库
# (absorb建议池→decide处置→recheck复核→fix+verify智能修复→git上传→落库投喂 六步闭环; smart_mount注册sys_ai_suggested_repair 600s轮巡)
!flask-app/engines/ai_suggested_repair_engine.py
!flask-app/engines/ai_smart_mount_engine.py
# 2026-08-18 B1守卫P0修复: 允许 flask-app/app/ 下核心修复文件入库
# (三段式匹配+category分支响应+运行时category推导, TEST_P0_VERIFY 100%通过)
!flask-app/app/
flask-app/app/*
!flask-app/app/__init__.py
!flask-app/app/utils/
flask-app/app/utils/*
!flask-app/app/utils/b1_global_permission_guard.py
!flask-app/app/utils/ai_emp_badge.py
